{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……沒問題嗎？」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4484", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼？」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1643", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個蠢蛋和天羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不是我們該擔心的事吧？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1644", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣說是沒錯……可是身為情侶不是會想辦法讓對方打起精神來嗎？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明不管是誰來看，都知道天羽學姊在逞強……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1645", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不過，我到底為什麼會在意這種事呢？」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊～妳該不會是愛上新吾了？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1646", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「別說蠢話了。」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦好啦，也就是說，愛理小姐很重視夥伴吧。」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1647", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要調侃我啦，真是的……」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1648", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妳為什麼那麼冷靜呢？」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯？」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1649", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊被搶走，而且那傢伙還沒有安慰傷心的學姊的樣子。」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1650", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳啊什麼啊？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4493", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我看懂了。」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1651", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看懂了？」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾是個很厲害的傢伙。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1652", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「他哪裡厲害了？他不是只會笑咪咪看人臉色而已嗎？」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理妳不懂啦……」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1653", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就因為不輕易安慰，所以才說那傢伙厲害啊。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1654", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……因為那傢伙保持笑容，所以美羽學姊才能打起精神啊。」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1655", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，這不是我們該插嘴的事。」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1656", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們只能在一旁守候。」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "sn1657", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_30.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是……」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar4499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
